      "body": "Queue task 13669 (#1936 unblocked remainder, recommendations 1 and 3). Adds a local-only append-only JSONL want log under the mcpx state dir: explicit capability requests via `mcpx want request`, plus automatically recorded empty registry searches from CLI/MCP/TUI and daemon paths. `mcpx want list` groups by normalized query with count and first-/last-seen; corrupt lines are skipped. No transmission. Out of scope: provider declarations gated on PR #4637, doctor/toolViews/tailscale items.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796777593&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7889&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7889&signature=28c20d814f84dd412b6b5ee12a028d627f619d6c75d761cb5bac568ed4ba94d1\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7889?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
