      "body": "Implements #1936 item 1 (queue task 8142): ship the tailscale adapter declaration exactly as the issue specifies.\n\n**What ships**\n\n- `pkgs/mcpx/examples/tailscale.json` — a `paths.adapters` declaration over the local `tailscale` CLI exposing exactly two tools, `listTailnet` and `listHostnames`, both `tailscale status --json` with `json: true`. No credential is declared or needed: the CLI session the user already has is the authentication.\n- `pkgs/mcpx/internal/cli/adapter_shipped_test.go` — pins the shipped file: it must load through `loadAdapterFiles` (so `Spec.Validate` passes), be the single `tailscale` adapter over the `tailscale` command, carry no env/runtime/bare mode, and expose exactly the two named tools with the exact args, JSON parsing, and no caller params.\n- `pkgs/mcpx/docs/configuration.md` — the declaration documented in the Adapter declarations section as the no-credential example, pointing at the shipped file.\n\n**Verified on the laptop worktree**\n\n- `go test ./internal/cli/ -run TestShippedTailscaleAdapterDeclaration -count=1` — PASS\n- `go test ./internal/adapter/ -count=1` — PASS\n- `MCPX_PATHS_ADAPTERS=$PWD/examples/tailscale.json go run ./cmd/mcpx adapter check` — \"1 adapters, all runnable.\"\n\nOut of scope (per the task packet): Dropbox/Drive/Outlook declarations (gated on PR #4637 in the #1936 triage) and the feedback/miss loop. Issue #1936 stays open for those.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796350034&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=5245&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F5245&signature=48a2dafa5601f3f8f5d581749e290af142bdda27d33ea726cf3c61aa31adc095\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)