      "body": "Fixes #1720.\n\n`LocalEvents::clear_tag` collected every live claim of a name into ONE `TagOp::Clear`, and `tag_claims::check_op` refuses a clear naming more than `MAX_CLEAR_CLAIMS` (256) claims — so a name with >256 live claims on a subject could never be cleared, and every attempt failed.\n\nPer the contract pinned by triage task 1936:\n- `clear_tag` now records one `tag.clear` event per chunk of at most `MAX_CLEAR_CLAIMS` claims (constant imported from `tag_claims`; no new literal), in the order `tag_claims()` returns them, until no live claim of the name remains.\n- Return contract (signature unchanged): the count is the total cleared across all chunks; the returned `Hash` is the FINAL chunk event's ID. Documented in the doc comment, including the append-only partial-failure semantics (earlier chunks stay recorded; a re-call clears the remainder).\n- Nothing-to-clear still errors; the ≤256 path records exactly one event, as before.\n\nTests (laptop, `cargo test --lib local_events::` — 5 passed, 0 failed):\n- 257 live claims → exactly 2 clear events (256 + 1), returns 257 and the second event's ID, no live claim of the name remains; other names and the same name on other subjects untouched.\n- 600 live claims → 3 chunk events (256 + 256 + 88), all cleared.\n- ≤ cap → single event, same return; nothing-to-clear still errors.\n\nQueue task 1945 (repo-health-code-pilot).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/1768?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795803810&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=1768&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F1768&signature=c33e2867ed62b9de756a5d01afdd9835db0c495108d68719f3de6c60e3413340\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
